    "summary": "Woman&#039;s belt made of skin comprising a wide central band and a separate narrow thong used as a tie. Central band has two sets of three strings of cowrie shells sewn onto the skin with cotton thread, each terminating at one end in strings of red, yellow and black plastic beads. Further strings of green, orange, light blue, yellow, white and black plastic beads sewn in vertical rows at both ends. Hole in skin band at one end for attaching skin thong.",
